   VmRSS=4088 kB vs limit 67108864 bytes
   mlockall(MCL_CURRENT) rc=0 errno=0 (Success)
   VmLck=7296 kB

== swap on this box (why realtime wants mlock) ==
   /proc/swaps:
     Filename				Type		Size		Used		Priority
     /dev/sdc                                partition	16777216	0		-2
   /proc/sys/vm/swappiness: 60
   locked pages never swap out -- that is the whole pitch; forcing deterministic swap-out here would need root (drop_caches) or dangerous memory pressure, recorded as-is

